`table` must be a table type (`table = Todo`) or a table name (`table = "todos"`)
`batch` must be an integer literal, e.g. `batch = 100`
`name` must be a string literal, e.g. `name = "0002_add_priority"`
the return type must be `Result<T>` (`ferrix::Result<T>` or `anyhow::Result<T>`)
parameter patterns must be plain identifiers
